# player-subtick-corpus.manifest - rows of tests/harness/check_player_subtick.sh.
#   <bk2> | <lo>-<hi>[,<lo>-<hi>...]
#   bk2    a movie under games/spyro-2/bk2
#   span   a range of intermediate-present VBLs, two apart; every VBL of it
#          but the first is a leg, compared with the capture two VBLs earlier
# Ice skating: the body advances one keyframe per four ticks with long head
# travel; the advances fall on legs 921, 929, 1121, 1129 and 1161. The
# reflective ice draws the mirrored copy, measured as its own series.
colossus-ice-skating.bk2 | 913-931,1113-1131,1153-1167
# Walking and a portal entry: a keyframe advance nearly every tick at short
# head travel.
autumn-plains-skelos-badlands-portal-entry.bk2 | 951-1077
